{"4261290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MELLDESTROY", "steam_appid": 4261290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay demons in massive waves!<br>Hell is empty because all demons came for you. Their mistake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced roguelike action game where the famous Mellstroy tears through hordes of demons left and right. But there’s a twist: the demons are dangerous bloggers — recognizable, arrogant, and pushed to absurd extremes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple, fast, and nonstop: you run, survive, and destroy everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you spin weapon slots, roll buffs, abilities, and insane effects, and take risks to create powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One screen, hundreds of enemies, tons of humor, and pure азарт instead of boring upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible.<br>Score more points than anyone else and become #1 on the MELLDESTROY leaderboard!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay demons in massive waves!<br>Hell is empty because all demons came for you. Their mistake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced roguelike action game where the famous Mellstroy tears through hordes of demons left and right. But there’s a twist: the demons are dangerous bloggers — recognizable, arrogant, and pushed to absurd extremes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple, fast, and nonstop: you run, survive, and destroy everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you spin weapon slots, roll buffs, abilities, and insane effects, and take risks to create powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One screen, hundreds of enemies, tons of humor, and pure азарт instead of boring upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible.<br>Score more points than anyon